Human in the loop is an independent implementation for Codex, inspired by
the interaction model of Tzafrir Rehan's MIT-licensed Claude Code mod:
https://github.com/tzafrir/human-in-the-loop

The Claude-specific implementation and local user data are not bundled.
No affiliation with or endorsement by Anthropic or OpenAI is implied.

Bundled dependencies retain their own licenses in dist/licenses. Consult
package-lock.json for exact versions, source archives and integrity hashes.
